 was a misjudgment, yet instead of fixing it, they are engaging in a pointless power struggle with players. Even if a full rollback is not possible, they show no intention of changing the gameplay system. On top of that, in this season they claim to be improving player experience, but instead they added Power Level scaling reductions to regular content, making an already difficult experience even harder.\n\nAnd that’s not all. Instead of allowing synergy with existing gear, the game now forces players to use only new equipment through game systems and modifiers. This makes all previously collected gear—whether from returning or veteran players—effectively worthless. Years of gear stored in the vault, collected for memories, have all been dismantled.\n\nSo how are you supposed to raise your Power Level? Every 2–3 weeks, a limited-time event content opens for about two weeks. The difficulty is extremely low, and players are expected to grind this content to raise their Power Level. But is repeating a single piece of content for 4–5 hours really fun? I have much more to say, but I’ve already covered the main points above, so I’ll stop here.\n\nThe story itself is very well made. However, it can be completed in just two days, and there is very little side story content. While the story quality is good, the amount of content is smaller than that of a typical mobile game’s event story.\n\nIn conclusion, thanks to a gameplay design that completely ignores player convenience, the player population is rapidly declining. Some content can no longer find matches at all, and even when matchmaking does succeed, the difficulty of normal content is set to near endgame-level difficulty. Unless you are a top-tier player, playing is practically impossible. Whether you are trying to play the game or raise your Power Level, the gameplay simply isn’t fun anymore.	f	226372	koreana	2025-10-07 13:49:42	2026-06-05 04:31:34.048599
